   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Can I…?** sirve para pedir permiso (**ask for permission**): **Can I use your phone?** (¿puedo usar tu teléfono?). **Can you…?** sirve para pedirle algo a otra persona: **Can you help me?** (¿puedes ayudarme?).",
     "@en": "**Can I…?** is used to order permission (**ask for permission**): **Can I use your phone?** (can I use your phone?). **Can you…?** serves to ask someone else for something: **Can you help me?** (can you help me?)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Para sonar amable, añadimos **please**: **Can I use this socket, please?**",
     "@en": "To sound kind, add **please**: **Can I use this socket, please?**"
    },
    {
     "@es": "En este nivel practicamos estas fórmulas frecuentes con **can**.",
     "@en": "At this level we practice these frequent formulas with **can**."
    }
   ]
